    81→    /// <remarks>
    82→    /// Full and correct validation is only possible in the context of a specific block
    83→    /// as we cannot generalize correctness of the transaction without knowing the EIPs implemented
    84→    /// and the world state(account nonce in particular).
    85→    /// Even without protocol change, the tx can become invalid if another tx
    86→    /// from the same account with the same nonce got included on the chain.
    87→    /// As such, we can decide whether tx is well formed as long as we also validate nonce
    88→    /// just before the execution of the block / tx.
    89→    /// </remarks>
    90→    public ValidationResult IsWellFormed(Transaction transaction, IReleaseSpec releaseSpec) =>
